{"ticker":{"symbol":"138070.KQ","name":"신진에스엠","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1350.0,"change_pct":0.008968609865470878,"market_cap":22635898880.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.022222222222222223,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":2220.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Tools & Accessories","country":"South Korea","city":"Jangsu-eup","employees":null,"website":"https://www.shinjin-sm.co.kr","business_summary":"Shinjin Sm Co.,Ltd. engages in the manufacture and sale of standard materials in South Korea, Japan, Thailand, and internationally. The company offers standard plates, such as carbon steel, stainless steel, aluminum, and special steel plates; plates for mold base; and circular saws. It also provides processing equipment, such as STC-3500, a circular saw cutting machine for metal plates; STVI-300, 800, 700, and 500, quadrilateral milling machines; STHM-300, 700, and 500, plain milling machines; STV-1300, 3200, and 2400, lateral milling machines; NHC series, a Nishijima round bar cutting machine; and Nishijima ND type series for leftover reduction type, as well as l-brackets and blocks. Further, the company engages in machinery manufacturing, and steel plate processing and sale. Shinjin Sm Co.,Ltd. was founded in 1991 and is headquartered in Jangsu-eup, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"(주)신진에스엠 한국, 일본, 태국 및 해외에서 표준 자재의 제조 및 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 탄소강, 스테인레스강, 알루미늄, 특수강판 등 표준판을 제공합니다. 몰드 베이스용 플레이트; 그리고 원형톱. 또한 금속판용 원형톱 절단기인 STC-3500; STVI-300, 800, 700 및 500, 사변형 밀링 머신; STHM-300, 700 및 500, 일반 밀링 머신; STV-1300, 3200, 2400, 측면 밀링 머신; NHC 시리즈, 니시지마 환봉 절단기; 잔반감소형 니시지마 ND형 시리즈, L형 브라켓, 블록 등이 있습니다. 또한, 기계제조, 강판 가공 및 판매업도 영위하고 있습니다. (주)신진에스엠 1991년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 장수읍에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"공구","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":66325154090.0,"oper